    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e0e3527d30f91b732ed4581",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不想和我妹妹之间留下芥蒂。\n这种关系保持下去的话，\n我妹妹以后会不愿跟我说话的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f5224714a62990070ee04f85f702b2a2663f4d6699ffa3a595b120e3d212af8",
